Room: the real AppKit parent for Apple's passkey authorization sheet.

Chromium 157 configures iCloud passkey discovery only when it can find an
NSWindow through a Views Widget. Room embeds its pages in AppKit; its Views
modal anchor is a separate child window, not the page's parent. Ask //room
for a native parent before the existing Views lookup. Non-Room pages and
detached pages return null and keep Chromium's path. Nothing changes RP ID,
origin validation, credential selection, cancellation or entitlement checks.

Phase 6.6, 2026-11-03. //room: room/core/room_web_contents_tools.mm.
